                    <msPart xml:id="p1">
                        <msIdentifier/>
                        <msContents><summary/>
                            <msItem xml:id="p1_i1">
                                <locus from="2r" to="13v"/>
                                <title ref="LIT4744GadlaEn"/>
                                <note>According to the text, the spiritual father of 
                                    <persName ref="PRS3801endreyas"><roleName type="title">ʾAbuna</roleName> ʾƎndrǝyās</persName>  was 
                                    <persName ref="PRS4282GabraKr">Gabra Krǝstos of Dabra Salodā</persName> (cf. <locus target="#5r #13r"/>).
                                    <persName ref="PRS3801endreyas"/> was an itinerant monk, who spent the greater part of his life in 
                                    <placeName ref="LOC1945Bogos"/> (cf. e.g. <locus target="#7v"/>), where he encountered pilgrims traveling to 
                                    <placeName ref="LOC3957Jerusa"/>. One of these pilgrims was <persName ref="PRS9059Taamna"/>, who was 
                                    to remain with him. The commemoration of <persName ref="PRS3801endreyas"/> falls on 
                                    <date ref="ethiocal:Yakkatit1">the first of Yakkātit</date> (cf. <locus target="#13r"/>). 
                                    The gadl was composed at the behest of the Holy Spirit, as conveyed by Melchizedek <!-- PRS6988Melchize ? --> to the monk Gabra Śəllase <!-- PRS ID -->,
                                    who asked another monk, <persName ref="PRS8322saggaHa">Ṣaggā Hāymanot</persName>, to write it down
                                    (cf. <locus target="#13r"/>).</note>
                                <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ኦሥሉስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ቅዱስ። አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ክስት፡ አፉየ፡ ወአብርህ፡ አዕይንተ፡ ልብየ፡ ወተናገር፡ በላዕሌየ።
                                    ወሱጥ፡ መንፈሰከ፡ ውስተ፡ ልሳንየ፤ ከመ፡ እንግር፡ ገድሉ። ወበእንተ፡ ልደቱ፡ ለእንድርያስ፡ ብፁዕ፡ ዘኃረዮ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ዘብሔረ፡ አግአዚት፡ ኮከብ፡ ዘሰረቀ፡
                                    እመንገለ፡ አዜብ። ወሀሎ፡ ፩ ብእሲ፡ በአለ፡ ጋዳ፡ ክቡረ፡ ዘመድ፡ እመኳንንተ፡ ሀገር፡ ዘስሙ፡ ዘአማኑኤል። ወባዕል፡ ጥቀ፡ ወቦቱ፡ ብእሲተ፡ መሃይምንተ። 
                                    እምዐበይተ፡ ሀገር፡ ይእቲ፡ ወስማ፡ አመተ፡ መንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ወክልኤሆሙ፡ ጻድቃን፡ እሙንቱ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                        </msContents>
