                            <handDesc>
                                <handNote xml:id="h1" script="Ethiopic">
                                    <desc>Beautiful handwriting. According to <bibl><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/>
                                        <citedRange unit="item">84, I</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">217</citedRange>
                                        <citedRange unit="note">2</citedRange></bibl>, the name of the copier or of the copier of the Vorlage was 
                                        <persName ref="PRS15536TanseaKr" role="scribe">Tanśǝʾa Krǝstos</persName>, who is mentioned probably 
                                        on <locus target="#13v"/> (incicated as ‘31v’ by Stefan Strelcyn, what is likely to be incorrect, because the 
                                        codicological unit ranges from <locus from="1" to="19"/> and the text ends in <locus target="#13v"/>).</desc>
                                    <seg type="ink">European ink, black and red.</seg>
                                </handNote>
                            </handDesc>
                            <additions>
                                <list>
                                    <item xml:id="a1">
                                        <locus target="#14r"/>
                                        <desc type="GuestText">
                                            A <ref type="work" corresp="LIT6591MonGenealogy">genealogy of Ethiopian monks</ref>,
                                            written in ten lines.</desc>
                                        <q xml:lang="gez">እንጦንዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለመቃር<add place="below">ዮ</add>ስ፤ ወመቃርዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለጳላምን፤ ወጳላምን፡ ወለዶ፡ 
                                            ለአርሳንዮስ፤ ወአርሳንዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለአኖሬዮስ፤ ወአ<add place="below">ኖ</add>ሬዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለጳኵሚስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለአርጋዊ፤ ወአረጋዊ፡ 
                                            ወለዶ፡ ለተክለ፡ ሀይማኖት፤ ወተክለ፡ ሀይማኖት፡ ወለዶ፡ ለመድኃኒነ፡ እግዚእ፤ ወመድኃኒነ፡ እግዚእ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለሳሙኤል፡ ዘቆየጻ፤ ወሳሙኤል፡ ዘቆየጻ፡ 
                                            ወለዶ፡ ለገብረ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ዘሰሎዳ፤ ወገብረ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለእንድርያስ፡ ዘፂዳርዋ፤ ወእንድርያስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለዘካርያስ፡ ወለያሬድ፡ ወለዮሐንስ። 
                                            <gap reason="ellipsis"/></q>
                                    </item>
                                    <item xml:id="e2">
                                        <desc>Title of the work.</desc>
                                    </item>
